of darts in traversal order that agree with o. For an even cycle, the counts along the two traversals have the same parity, so 'either traversal' does not depend on which one is taken. Equivalent to the definition in GSW2023 Section 4. The 'induce' on the page is the SphereMap one, but this Lean uses SimpleGraph.induce, which is the intended operation. No cited-source block was supplied, so there is no cited gate."}],"substrate_gates":[],"escalate":null}

